    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n25600" root="ضحك" body-key="D">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ضَحُوكٌ</span></b> : see <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ضُحَكَةٌ</span>. ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  [Also] A man <i>cheerful
in countenance.</i> (O.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  And (assumed tropical:)  <i>A wide road:</i> (S,
