road;</i> as also ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ضَحَّاكٌ</span></b> : pl. of the former (in this
sense, TA) <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ضُحْكٌ</span>. (K, TA.)

